      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2013–2024\nRAPID RESPONSE\nCONTENT\n\nThreat logic ships\nas data files, not\ncode.\n\nNo new release.\nNo reboot.\n\nMinutes to react to\na brand-new attack\ntechnique.",
