      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "04:09 UTC, JUL 19\nCHANNEL FILE 291\n\nNew IPC template:\n21 fields declared,\nsensor code reads\nonly 20.\n\nContent Validator\nchecks syntax, not\nfield-count mismatch.\n\nShipped to every\nsensor at once —\nno staged rings.",
