      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⚡ THE CRASH\n\nFalcon runs in Ring 0\nto see attacks before\nthey're catalogued.\n\nOut-of-bounds read →\nan exception nothing\ncan catch there.\n\nBSOD → reboot →\nsame file loads →\nBSOD again.\n\n8.5M machines\nstuck in the loop.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⚡ THE CRASH\n\nFalcon runs in Ring 0\nto see attacks before\nthey're catalogued.\n\nOut-of-bounds read →\nan exception nothing\ncan catch there.\n\nBSOD → reboot →\nsame file loads →\nBSOD again.\n\n8.5M machines\nstuck in the loop.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
