      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AUG 2024\nWHAT CHANGED\n\nFile pulled 05:27\nUTC — 78 min in.\n\nContent updates now\nget staged rollouts +\ncustomer-controlled\ndeployment rings,\nlike sensor code\nalways had.\n\nValidator now checks\nfield count + type.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AUG 2024\nWHAT CHANGED\n\nFile pulled 05:27\nUTC — 78 min in.\n\nContent updates now\nget staged rollouts +\ncustomer-controlled\ndeployment rings,\nlike sensor code\nalways had.\n\nValidator now checks\nfield count + type.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
